Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf: Userspace software event and ioctl
Date: Thu, 18 Sep 2014 15:34:33 +0100
Message-Id: <1411050873-9310-3-git-send-email-pawel.moll@arm.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.9.1
In-Reply-To: <1411050873-9310-1-git-send-email-pawel.moll@arm.com>
References: <1411050873-9310-1-git-send-email-pawel.moll@arm.com>
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
